{"availability":"available","full":"Metalloriff/sucralose","name":"sucralose","description":"A humble front-end replacement for https://e621.net, using their API. With mobile support, subscriptions, and more.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":5,"forks":3,"created":"2021-09-08T00:59:16Z","updated":"2025-05-22T06:01:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sucralose.top","topics":["booru","booru-browser","booru-image-viewer","e621","furry","furry-fandom","gallery","gallery-viewer","modernized","nsfw","nsfw-app","progressive-web-app","pwa","react","reactjs","webapp","website"],"demo":"https://sucralose.top/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:28.886Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:28.886Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:28.886Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.346Z","stars":5,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:18:28.886Z","stars":5,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sucralose is a humble, modern front-end replacement for using their API/back-end.","The goal is to provide a smoother, more user-friendly and mobile-friendly experience, along with extra customization.","The login allows you to store your e621 username and API key in a shared account between devices, along with the ability to add custom features like subscriptions, saved searches, and quick blacklist switching via my database."],"features":["Clean UI, smooth UX -- A modernized UI that ensures a smooth and user-friendly experience.","Subscriptions -- You can subscribe to artists/tags, with the ability to view all posts from your subscribed tags via the \"subscriptions\" page. If you install the PWA on your mobile device, you will also receive…","Multiple blacklist and quick switching -- The quick blacklists feature allows you to create an infinite number of different blacklists that you can quickly switch between via a dropdown menu on the posts page. The…","Easy pool viewing -- Posts that are part of a pool have a # icon, where you can quickly view all posts in the pool.","Easy set management -- You can add and remove posts from your sets just by right clicking the post! All of your sets will show up underneath a sub-menu. Much easier than the original way to manage sets!"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Metalloriff/sucralose/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3145cda28ad2f2d071440f7c554225e63934c46095a694d2c0967f7e1600427d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.473Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.473Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Sucralose is a humble, modern front-end replacement for using their API/back-end.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Metalloriff/sucralose/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The login allows you to store your e621 username and API key in a shared account between devices, along with the ability to add custom features like subscriptions, saved searches, and quick blacklist switching via my database.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Metalloriff/sucralose/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The login allows you to store your e621 username and API key in a shared account between devices, along with the ability to add custom features like subscriptions, saved searches, and quick blacklist switching via my database.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Metalloriff/sucralose/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"If you don't want to login, it is possible to browse the site without your e621 account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Metalloriff/sucralose/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3145cda28ad2f2d071440f7c554225e63934c46095a694d2c0967f7e1600427d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Metalloriff/sucralose/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.473Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-05-22T06:01:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"sa